                "text": "Throughout my time in the Senate, connecting West Virginia with reliable broadband coverage has been a top priority.\n\u00a0\nToday, I joined state and local officials in Spencer to celebrate the dedication of a multi-county fiber network project, made possible by collaboration between Citynet and local entities in Roane County.\n\u00a0\nPartnerships like this with Citynet, show the impact we can make when it comes to better-serving communities and advancing our goal of connecting more homes and businesses here in West Virginia to high-speed internet access.",
